{"4732960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Go to the Bathroom", "steam_appid": 4732960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE CAREFUL WHAT CHANGED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/f2cc58d6f17b32fbd7f2080d44a27167.poster.avif?t=1786097988\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/f2cc58d6f17b32fbd7f2080d44a27167.webm?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/f2cc58d6f17b32fbd7f2080d44a27167.mp4?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You woke up in Grandma's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's late at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/1308b62820624c474341ea0bee48ac4d.webp?t=1786097988\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma is asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/94065d6fb5e16d68b61c32a2c1baeadf.poster.avif?t=1786097988\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/94065d6fb5e16d68b61c32a2c1baeadf.webm?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/94065d6fb5e16d68b61c32a2c1baeadf.mp4?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/4541757509f7e833d4ef2cba390820f8.webp?t=1786097988\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RULE IS SIMPLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/90f69335b7a473772a9cee2ba1811f80.poster.avif?t=1786097988\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/90f69335b7a473772a9cee2ba1811f80.webm?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/90f69335b7a473772a9cee2ba1811f80.mp4?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something changed—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/112dd2114ed501c18e4694b454691885.webp?t=1786097988\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nothing feels wrong—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct choices let you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong choices may bring something closer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the hallway and carefully observe your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, small changes and anomalies may appear in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some changes are obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are difficult to notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice something unusual, turn back immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nothing changed, continue toward the bathroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct decisions allow you to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong decisions reset your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Psychological anomaly-spotting gameplay<br>• Multiple anomalies and environmental changes<br>• Subtle visual and audio differences<br>• Atmospheric first-person horror<br>• Inspired by childhood fears and late-night paranoia<br>• Short immersive horror experience</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The place that always felt safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until tonight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the hallway feels different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/17c076fe1b523dbaccbf3f807db18faf.poster.avif?t=1786097988\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/17c076fe1b523dbaccbf3f807db18faf.webm?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/17c076fe1b523dbaccbf3f807db18faf.mp4?t=1786097988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE CAREFUL WHAT CHANGED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4732960/extras/f2cc58d6f17b32fbd7f2080d44a27167.poster.avif?